  # moonshotai: kimi via official CN endpoint. Full custom provider — the bundled
  # catalog has no moonshot provider (only vercel-ai-gateway/opencode kimi variants).
  # Metadata: models.dev moonshotai-cn + live /v1/models (2026-08-01).
  # Key: Keychain on macOS, MOONSHOT_API_KEY env elsewhere.
